Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:05.69,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:10.61,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And I mean... since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:14.67,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,I just thought you're a pretty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:22.91,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,So, do you like anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.57,0:00:32.73,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:34.53,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:37.05,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I didn't mean for it to...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:38.76,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:46.48,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, if what you said back there is true...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:51.11,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry for being \Ninconsiderate this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:56.66,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Also, if what you said is true...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.20,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I can't reciprocate your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:03.23,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:06.51,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:12.98,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I knew... you'd probably \Nsay that, Yoi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:16.97,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,That's part of why I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:24.34,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,So, let's continue to be work buddies,\Nall the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:29.18,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:44.61,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Was this... really the right thing to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:51.10,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.73,0:01:55.25,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I sure got rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:43.53,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:44.92,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:50.35,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoshiko?! I thought you \Nwere in Switzerland!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.35,0:03:53.03,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Heh heh, it's summer break!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.03,0:03:54.30,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What do ya mean, "heh heh"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.96,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,How did you find me, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:58.59,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Auntie told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:01.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That old hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:03.34,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Such a dirty mouth! You're the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:07.15,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,I came all the way back to Japan, \Nand you weren't even home, Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:09.70,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,And so, I came to you instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:11.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, gee, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:12.91,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.91,0:04:14.27,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:18.44,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Is that any way to treat a childhood \Nfriend you haven't seen in forever?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:22.11,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Anyone who speaks higher than\Nsixty decibels isn't allowed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.11,0:04:23.95,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Huh? Are you telling me I'm loud?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.10,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,That's so not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.10,0:04:26.45,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,I'm so chill, if I were—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:27.87,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.99,0:04:30.36,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,There's nothing here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:31.84,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:34.87,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm telling you right now, I don't \Nhave drinks or anything, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.82,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,People don't come over, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:41.31,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,I hear good fortune stagnates \Nin a house where no one visits!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:43.19,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, wish she'd go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:45.09,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, more importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.77,0:04:48.55,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,could you go out to dinner with me today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:49.59,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:52.13,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:56.31,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,I went to eat with a friend, and the \Nguy working there was super hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:59.83,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,I want to go again today, but it's \Nembarrassing going by myself, ya know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:01.98,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,So wanna go together?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:03.74,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wanna {\i1}not{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:05.35,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:07.79,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Come on, you've got nothin' to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.92,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,And you're getting a meal out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:10.76,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's tiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.76,0:05:12.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Why don't you just go with that friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:13.81,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:17.73,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,If I went with a girl, I wouldn't \Nwant her to fall in love with him, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.73,0:05:19.65,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Going with a guy friend \Nwould get complicated,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:22.02,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,so I'd rather go with someone \Nwho has no interest in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:24.05,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Seriously, won't she go home already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.11,0:05:24.05,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fnArial Black\pos(116.666,184.667)\frz12.98}Refuses to share a fave
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:28.80,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Besides, I have a girlfriend now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:30.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.01,0:05:33.23,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Huh?! A new girl again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:35.38,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Your girlfriend turnover rate is too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:37.44,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,I'll never understand you popular guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:40.94,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Y'know, you're just gonna \Nbreak up with her anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.95,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,What's the harm of one little dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:45.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm not breaking up with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:46.94,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:52.84,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Who is this sulking Kohaku?! So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:56.08,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Before, he'd just laugh it off\Nand take it as a joke...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:59.04,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,He does have a childish side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:02.04,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of person \Nis your current girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:03.94,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:06.42,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,No particular reason. Just wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.49,0:06:09.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.01,0:06:12.01,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,She's proper, yet ditsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.74,0:06:14.63,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,She quickly gets shy \Nand turns bright red...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:21.52,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,She's old-school, stubborn, and acts \Nlike a shonen manga hero sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.97,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sometimes she's so bold, \Nit actually scares me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.42,0:06:28.47,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Before I'd say she was "beautiful," but,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:30.55,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,the more I get to know her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:33.39,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,the more I see these \Ninscrutable sides to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:36.76,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,making it difficult to \Nform a full picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:43.42,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,She likes sweet things.\NEspecially smooth red bean paste.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:45.25,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Your lackluster vernacular\Nis beyond hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:47.06,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:48.93,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,If you go out to dinner with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:51.75,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,I'll tell you about a place \Nwith delicious sweets!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:55.58,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, as if that \None's gonna work on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:56.59,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:06:58.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You will?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:01.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You're a good pal, Yoshiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:02.56,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:04.06,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.06,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yep. Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:06.10,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,All right, I'm gonna go change!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:11.74,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Wh-What was that face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:14.09,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Between this and that sulking face from earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.09,0:07:16.94,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,it's obvious that this isn't \Nthe Kohaku I've known!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:20.04,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,If I were to ask him, "What type of \Nperson is she?" before, he'd be like...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:21.42,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Don't remember much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:25.69,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,And would answer with no interest at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.69,0:07:29.47,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,The fact that he remembers that she \N"likes sweet things" is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:33.33,italics,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Just how cute is his new girlfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.33,0:07:35.68,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:35.72,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs32\c&HD9E2EB&\3c&H4675BB&\pos(321.333,140)}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:35.76,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs26\c&HD9E2EB&\3c&H4675BB&\pos(326,102.667)}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:35.80,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs20\c&HD9E2EB&\3c&H4675BB&\pos(326.667,82.667)}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:35.85,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs16\c&HD9E2EB&\3c&H4675BB&\pos(328,68.667)}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:35.89,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs15\c&HD9E2EB&\3c&H4675BB&\pos(330.667,60)}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:38.64,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs14\t(0,2750,\fs13.5)\c&HD9E2EB&\3c&H4675BB&\move(330.667,57.333,331.333,56,0,2734)}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:41.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh. So, {\i1}this{\i0} is the place\Nyou were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.67,0:07:42.40,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:44.61,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, see?! Right there!\NThe hottie I was talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:49.25,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.25,0:07:51.96,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoshiko did like those rugged, \Nolder actors and such, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:54.62,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, my heart's pounding so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.24,0:08:00.70,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs10\c&HF0F7FC&\3c&H4675BB&\frx6\fry342\frz7.48\pos(462.667,24)}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:57.24,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Weren't there two \Nother beauties there too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:58.27,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,What? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.27,0:08:00.70,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Right, you only see the one\N you're interested in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:02.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:03.75,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Welp...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.41,0:08:06.42,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I get to see Yoi-chan, too, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:09.13,Default,DAD AND OJI,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:11.34,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Oh, you having curry today, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:13.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Yoi-chan today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.49,0:08:15.22,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Oh, she's off today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:17.18,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? Are you serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.07,0:08:19.68,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Too bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:23.14,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Her friends came crying to her, so \Nshe's helping them with their homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:24.75,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Hmm? Who's she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:28.45,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Huh! Oh... Um, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.94,0:08:32.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, just a childhood friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:33.78,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:36.10,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Relax and enjoy your meal \Ntoday, too, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:36.10,top,GUEST VOICE,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:37.69,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:41.30,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Hey! What was {\i1}that{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.75,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,You {\i1}know{\i0} him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:48.47,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm? Yeah, I know him in a,\N"He's my girlfriend's dad" sort of way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:51.92,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(88,0)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs40\pos(320,4.667)}Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:51.41,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:52.97,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:53.83,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:58.41,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,But... But, if he has a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:00.30,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Then I've definitely got no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:01.72,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:03.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Why don't you just choose a curry for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.43,0:09:11.19,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Her friends came crying to her,\Nso she took off... huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:15.25,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wonder if she'd take a day off\Nif I came crying to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:21.83,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be bad if Yoi-san saw this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:24.56,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I didn't know what I was \Ndoing at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:29.97,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,but I said things to Yoi-san that\N encouraged her to be with this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:35.80,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,No, this isn't any of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:40.64,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Oh man. I'm stuffed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:42.82,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You sure ate a lot, Yoshiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:44.81,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,I'm just stress-eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:48.05,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:50.43,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Could you cover me?\NI'll pay you back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.43,0:09:51.31,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:56.76,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\b1\fs10\c&H3B4138&\pos(316,35.333)\frz344.5}I'll wait in front of the convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:56.76,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\b1\fs10\c&H3A4245&\pos(92.667,72)\frz345.3}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:56.76,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\b1\fs10\c&H2D352E&\pos(303.334,251.333)\frz343.7}Are you still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:58.20,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1.52\b1\fs10\c&HFBFEF2&\frz345.3\3c&H8EA448&\pos(282.001,33.333)}Today
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:03.37,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\b1\fs15\c&H343B3E&\pos(143.334,220.667)\frx6\fry354\frz346.2}Did you get the homework done?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:06.42,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Am I being a creeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:09.58,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1.5\b1\fs10\c&HFBFEF2&\frz345.3\3c&H8EA448&\pos(282.001,33.333)}Today
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:10.79,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\b1\fs10\c&H2D352E&\frz343.7\pos(336.001,142)}Are you still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:10.79,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\b1\fs10\c&HE5F0DF&\3c&H8EA448&\pos(210.001,267.333)\frx2\fry0\frz343.8}Message deleted
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:10.79,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1.5\b1\fs10\c&HEBF4DA&\3c&H8EA448&\frx2\fry0\frz344.9\pos(232.668,208.667)}Today
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.99,0:10:17.03,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm not used to texting, so\NI don't know what normal people say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:21.14,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Your total comes to three thousand yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:23.85,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'll pay with card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.07,0:10:28.77,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:30.73,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Can I start heading to your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:31.96,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:33.69,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,I forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:35.95,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Keys, if you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:38.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Stop messing around, Yoshiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:40.29,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.31,0:10:43.49,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,He should...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.58,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,He should...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.22,0:10:50.19,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Don't you think you should \Nbehave a bit more sincerely?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:54.59,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I don't like this person very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:04.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.99,0:11:05.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Whaddya mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:10.52,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,You know, taking a girl to dinner\N when you have a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.31,0:11:16.20,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,No, I shouldn't be talking, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:20.99,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Anyway, does Yoi-san know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:23.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You mean about Yoshiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:25.56,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's not like that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:29.16,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,And this really has nothing \Nto do with you, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.69,0:11:30.62,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,He's spot-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:34.08,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? You like Yoi-chan or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:44.26,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I've already told her...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:48.50,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:11:52.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.76,0:11:53.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What do you mean by—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.09,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Kohaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:57.02,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Which way was the house again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:58.69,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,I can't figure it out by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:12:00.20,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoshiko, you—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:02.31,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, you're done paying already!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.31,0:12:03.57,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.05,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.05,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:06.66,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:07.58,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:14.04,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:18.30,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,My friend, who just called me, told me \Nabout a delicious sweets shop, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:21.17,Default,YOSHIKO,0,0,0,,What? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:28.73,flashback italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I've already told her how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:32.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.11,0:12:41.23,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:43.39,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,am I even...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:48.70,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm gradually \Nturning into a terrible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.34,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Oh, Oji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:52.75,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Can we figure out your work schedule \Nfor next school term?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.19,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:03.15,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Ah... The morning light on the \Nfirst day of school is so bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:05.94,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we're able to see this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:08.85,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to Yoi-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You're going to bother people,\Nso please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.09,0:13:14.79,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,It really is all thanks to you, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:17.07,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,I really thought we'd never \Nfinish that homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.07,0:13:19.90,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,That's right. That's right. \NYou're a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.15,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:22.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm not helping you during \Nwinter break, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.21,0:13:24.81,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,'Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:24.45,top,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:26.70,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,They don't seem like they \Nfeel guilty at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:30.02,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,But we didn't ruin your plans \Nor anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:31.66,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Like meeting up with Senpai and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:34.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, we didn't have any, so it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:35.12,Default,NOBARA AND KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:39.50,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoi-chan, how many times have \Nyou met with Senpai since Kobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:44.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,He came to eat curry \Nat our place, so once?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:46.37,Default,NOBARA AND KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Once?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:49.63,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Wait, wait. You said he came to eat curry,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:52.11,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,so you only saw him for about an hour?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:54.04,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.10,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.10,0:13:57.95,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh, man. Poor Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.95,0:14:00.99,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I'll never understand you stubborn girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.99,0:14:03.73,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,B-But I had my own plans, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:06.32,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And we're planning on having a\N takoyaki party sometime, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:10.61,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,But, {\i1}Senpai{\i0} was the one who \Ninvited you to that, too, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.99,0:14:12.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:18.43,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan, couldn't you try and \Nbe more open for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.43,0:14:19.58,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:23.96,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,You were all about that contract, too. \NYou're lucky the Prince tolerates it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:27.92,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, they do have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:30.63,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,We weren't able to hang \Nout much because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.14,0:14:34.43,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Maybe I should be a little more proactive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:40.40,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And... I did want \Nto see Senpai more, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:44.14,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I mean it really was my own fault, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:52.03,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It feels like, lately,\NI always know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.29,0:14:53.40,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:55.27,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.49,0:14:58.35,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.61,0:15:02.01,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Did you bring that snack that you were \Neating during our homework session?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.01,0:15:04.85,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I did! A new flavor came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:04.51,top,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Right on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:07.41,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sorry, you two.\NCould you guys go on ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.69,0:15:12.75,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. I found \Nanother delicious curry place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.75,0:15:14.14,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Huh, where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:15.56,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,First floor of the station building!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:16.58,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh, didn't know there was one.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.56,0:15:18.27,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord2\fs15\c&H2D352E&\3c&H99A742&\pos(15.667,22.334)}Are you still awake?\N{\c&HE5F0DF&\3c&HA0B65C&}Message deleted\N{\c&HEBF4DA&\3c&H8EA448&}Today {\c&H38322D&\3c&HEDEDEA&}\NBehind you. Please, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:18.27,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&HBFE8A4&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 220 0 220 32 0 32
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:19.06,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's like an Asian \Ncafé kinda store, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:20.27,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,What, is it ethnic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:21.02,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.49,0:15:30.28,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry, gotta piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:31.30,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:41.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:42.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.67,0:15:45.59,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:49.05,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,H-Have you been well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:52.07,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah, super well.\NHow about you, Yoi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.50,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:56.49,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I mean, we did see each \Nother the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:15:57.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We did, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:06.82,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I need to be the proactive one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:08.61,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:08.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:09.66,Default,YOI AND KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:11.99,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Please go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:13.75,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No, you, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:15.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:17.41,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,If you don't, this conversation won't end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:22.87,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,After school today, would \Nyou like to go somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:28.46,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:31.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:35.87,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:38.76,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Just the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:41.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,an acquaintance of mine told me \Nabout a place with delicious sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:43.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What was it again? You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:46.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That thing where they put \Ntiny cakes on a plate,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:49.52,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,and has a name that \Nsounds like... "animation"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:51.52,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Do you mean afternoon tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:52.84,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah, that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:53.84,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:54.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Marvelous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.86,0:16:56.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:58.86,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's hooked on \Ncomplimenting me like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:01.37,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Only the "A" is the same, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:04.54,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's plan \Non meeting after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:05.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.30,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:25.77,flashback,OJI,0,0,0,,I've already told her how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:38.62,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:40.66,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's fancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:43.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But there's a lot of people waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.73,0:17:45.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It really must be a popular place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:49.45,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I-It's hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.45,0:17:51.63,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,A-Are you all right, Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:55.34,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That's right. He can't stand the heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.79,0:17:57.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm good, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.51,0:17:59.31,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We're just standing\Nin line for a bit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.62,0:18:00.68,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No sweat...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:03.10,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No, you're definitely sweating this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:04.31,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.31,0:18:07.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I finally get to go on a date with you.\N I don't wanna go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:09.06,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What are you, a child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:17.31,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Then, how about we get it to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:18.96,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Where are we gonna eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:24.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The park... would be hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:26.91,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,A k-karaoke room?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:30.57,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Hmm, can't eat at the library...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:34.21,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I didn't bring my parasol with me today...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.97,0:18:37.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:39.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wanna come over to my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:40.50,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:44.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not gonna force you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:45.63,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,To Senpai's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:47.74,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,house?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:51.07,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:55.66,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,taking one step ahead, before \Neven having the takoyaki party?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.65,0:18:59.82,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,No, I have to be the proactive one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:02.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.57,0:19:10.78,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you for having me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:13.25,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'll go get the table right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:17.01,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,This is Senpai's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:21.66,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's kind of empty...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.66,0:19:24.00,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Is this what a boy's room\Ntypically looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:24.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.55,0:19:29.06,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan, sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:30.09,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.38,0:19:33.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't have any seat pillows or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:36.48,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But isn't that your bedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:38.25,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.25,0:19:39.62,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:43.20,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Then, how about something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:48.13,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Now we're both on the bedding...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.13,0:19:50.87,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Why did I make it even more \Nnerve-wracking than it already was?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:53.58,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, why don't we start eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:56.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, yes! Let's!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.55,0:20:00.28,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I love sweet things,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:03.27,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,but I'm so nervous, I don't \Nknow if I'll be able to swallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:07.72,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:09.32,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm... sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:11.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The tea was hotter than I expected...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:16.79,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Did you burn yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.16,0:20:17.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.98,0:20:20.19,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.83,0:20:23.97,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know, you don't have \Nto be so on-guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:26.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm just worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:27.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.93,0:20:32.04,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's just that...\NI don't think I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.43,0:20:36.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Like, my heart already feels \Nlike it's about to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:53.39,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sen...pai...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.63,0:21:07.33,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:12.42,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder how far this is going to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.95,0:21:39.07,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.09,0:21:42.27,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.22,0:21:44.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:48.74,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Did something happen between \Nyou and that part-time guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.86,0:21:59.54,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,How... do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.47,0:22:15.33,sign_generic,EPTitle,0,0,0,,{\blur0.25\fade(529,412)\fs18\c&H39211F&\bord0\b1\fnComic Sans MS\t(4448,4860,\c&HFFFFFF&)\frz20.45\pos(340.001,214.665)}The Empty Room
